# ============================================================================
# ASTRO SIVAM — Namakaran (baby naming) NAME BANK
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source of truth for page 2 of the Vedic Namakaran report. Rebuild both report
# engines after any edit:
#     node scripts/build_namakaran_bank.mjs
#
# One row = one name suggestion.
#
# COLUMNS (pipe separated, exactly 7):
#   1. akshara  The pada letter of the birth star, exactly as printed by
#               src/lib/astrology/babynames.ts (e.g. சு, சே, லா).
#   2. gender   M = boy, F = girl
#   3. style    S = South Indian style, N = North Indian style
#   4. roman    Name in Roman script — printed by the English report
#   5. tamil    Hand-written Tamil spelling — printed by the Tamil report.
#               It MUST open with the exact letter of column 1 (சு -> சுதன்,
#               not செந்தில், which is the short-e செ that no pada prints).
#   6. hindi    Hand-written Devanagari spelling — printed by the Hindi report
#   7. meaning  Short English meaning (max 30 chars). Tamil and Hindi text for
#               every meaning lives in data/namakaran_meaning_glossary.psv.
#
# The old bank stored Roman spellings only and transliterated them when the
# report was printed, which produced wrong Tamil (சுதந்த்ஹிர, சுநில்). Names are
# now written by hand in all three scripts, and the generator rejects a row
# whose Tamil spelling does not start with its pada letter.
# ============================================================================
